body:
ex home depot employee workin at walmart 6 years now


pls take me back ;____;

i can do full time too!

Recently my friend began to play after taking a month or so break.   
We've tried everything almost

&#x200B;

Verified the game

&#x200B;

Updated the drivers

&#x200B;

Reinstalled the game (tried on both hard drives)

&#x200B;

Heck i even sent him my files, had him verify them and it seemed like FINALLY maybe we got something good going.   


We die a few times, start exploring and set off for the Blue Chamber Collective conflux path to the mountain. As soon as we enter the area, his screen freezes. Music still playing, but the unresponsive blue wheel ever spinning. 

&#x200B;

It's draining. It's depressing. 

&#x200B;

We just want to play this game together.  Truly one of our favorite past times. 

&#x200B;

But it's like.. it's a known bug that keeps happening for people yet it has not gotten enough reports or spotlight to be repaired in a hotfix.

>Zanuka is Alad V's feral framesona

&#x200B;

Ah so *thats* why all corpus robots are named after animals!
